  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_b7209ec1d616426aa4ed40c383ad6235",
      "statement": "The `easysam` CLI entrypoint in `src/easysam/cli.py` accepts shared options `--environment`, `--target-region`, `--aws-profile`, `--context-file`, and `--verbose` that form the deployment context (`deploy_ctx`) used by the `generate`, `deploy`, `inspect cloud`, and `delete` subcommands.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/cli.py#L24-L50",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cd3d9846694b7a51b30e60f08f33e89b7bf8bef4fa9fec3374f141eb222faeb9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83c057f3a03d48e4b2144e50aaa53e1f",
      "statement": "The `inspect schema` command (`src/easysam/inspect.py`) loads and resolves the full resource model and validates it against JSON Schema Draft 7 (`schemas.json` for global `resources.yaml`, `local_schemas.json` for per-file `easysam.yaml`) plus a set of custom validators covering buckets, tables, streams, lambdas, paths, imports, prismarine, authorizers, and MQTT.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/cli.py#L125-L125",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:849f32baa165cd05e9b982041c586bbcec36b7168a2790753c643b077cb0dc3e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/inspect.py#L34-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f033f8f90e9aceb4efc67a65d661105d524ef8f52a5520119c3082411255240b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_schema.py#L8-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:acb96084eaf371621c7dc92656e02cbd06bd92549a40cd41525e3859c12c2965:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e738bb29307e42a69fcdd69d6597cb60",
      "statement": "The custom schema validators enforce domain rules: `validate_buckets` (private bucket cannot be public), `validate_tables` (trigger function must exist in `functions`), `validate_streams` (exactly one of `bucketname`/`extbucketarn`, referenced buckets must exist, external ARNs must be valid), `validate_lambda` (resource references must resolve), `validate_paths` (`open` and `authorizer` are mutually exclusive; lambda paths must have one), `validate_import` (import directories exist), `validate_prismarine` (base directories exist), `validate_authorizers` (exactly one identity type; function must exist), and `validate_mqtt` (authorizer function must exist).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_schema.py#L170-L183",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3be3b667dfe2daf35c2c3ec2419b15ce5ea72d3551e61dba69158dc3cac40c81:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_schema.py#L277-L298",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a3adbc6c6643a17d0e5fafbea1050280b66c86e54fbe17508e9782f1f207be9f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_schema.py#L68-L108",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7d66a0d2cfc523ff2076805fe672ad5a5000dd75ec12e4a709c2dd554920a242:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fe954612dca642c89bce0b808b113120",
      "statement": "The `inspect cloud` command (`src/easysam/inspect.py`) validates live AWS resources that EasySAM references but does not manage: IAM policies for bucket `extaccesspolicy` references (must exist as `<PolicyName>-<environment>` in local IAM policies), SSM parameters for custom Lambda layers resolved via `{{resolve:ssm:...}}`, and direct Lambda layer ARN references (must be valid layer versions). It requires `--environment` and normally `--aws-profile`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/inspect.py#L71-L110",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4b116165d1f240881b7728f95896349ff64e7bd46d9cabfebffdd90fb39ca6fa:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_cloud.py#L25-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73629802418d43df5dd5d893ad1338f80bcbba9f88d44abf39eae575603b60f1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/validate_cloud.py#L6-L23",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a6987a07e9e628265ef8efc11742f916ea79fc7d90f22823935efe918b0b1a43:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_075002ee578244edbb8789d2c2d49bde",
      "statement": "The `deploy` command (`src/easysam/deploy.py`) regenerates the template internally via `generate()`, then runs version checks (pip ≥ 25.1.1, SAM CLI ≥ 1.138.0 via subprocess `--version` and `packaging.version.Version` comparison), removes and re-copies common dependencies via AST-based `commondep` tracing, runs `sam build`, runs `sam deploy` with stack name/parameters/capabilities/tags/region/profile, reconciles event source mappings for pollable functions, and cleans up common dependencies unless `--no-cleanup`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/deploy.py#L147-L211",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1b7362861764a86f5c7aead844bc56dcb444f0d97587d3a4819426e36b9ef322:"
        },
        {
