    },
    {
      "id": "claim_95b4971aa15148958cd1633fc9fb67c4",
      "statement": "The `delete` command (`src/easysam/deploy.py`) calls CloudFormation `delete_stack` directly (not via SAM CLI) with `DeletionMode` set to `FORCE_DELETE_STACK` when `--force` is passed, otherwise `STANDARD`; the `--await` flag polls `describe_stacks` until `DELETE_COMPLETE` or the stack is no longer present, raising `UserWarning` if the status is anything other than `DELETE_IN_PROGRESS` or `DELETE_COMPLETE`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/deploy.py#L59-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b4e748b2ab823fb986fbc94f6b0831c0ccbd6ed17f6b1b7745891c2595807191:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b148c77109ec4094a4196d3fe5bf71c8",
      "statement": "The `local` command group (`src/easysam/local_cli.py`) provides `easysam local .` (starts a local HTTP server mocking API Gateway routing) and `easysam local invoke <function>` (invokes a single function with a custom event), passing port/host/event-format/auth-context options and injecting `AWS_DEFAULT_REGION` and `AWS_PROFILE` from the CLI context when not already set.",
