    {
      "id": "claim_bd0166e96b65490f88f2ff1cb9841338",
      "statement": "The `cleanup` command (`src/easysam/cli.py`) calls `remove_common_dependencies(directory)` which removes any `common/` trees found under `backend/**/common` in the project directory, and is also called automatically during deploy unless `--no-cleanup` is passed.",
